    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:14980 | Any person may require the registrar to provide him with a copy of any certificate of incorporation of a company, signed by the registrar or authenticated by the registrar's seal.
@ref s 1065 Right to certificate of incorporation (src:14980)
