    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A document is not delivered to the registrar until it is received by the registrar" (an "until" bar, ruling of 2026-11-05 (d): once received the bar is lifted, and the text does not itself say the document has been delivered)
    ELSE JUST TRUE

-- The seam every filing section asks for (inputs/PLAN.md section 4.2: the day the registrar received the document).
